A tier with a `[clarify]` mark opening a sentence, an `[unknown]` mark opening a list item, a
mark mid-sentence and a broken link files three `clarify` items: each mark's record carries the
nearest heading's anchor, the mid-sentence mark files nothing, and the check finding's title is
`{check}: {message}` on the bare record ref.

